{"id":"fcd2431dc7fa995d","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-hardy-hierarchy.md","title":"Hardy 层次","display":"df-hardy-hierarchy — Hardy 层次","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-hardy-hierarchy","aliases":["72-df-hardy-hierarchy"],"display":"df-hardy-hierarchy — Hardy 层次","chapter":"III","depends_on":["[[72-df-tree-ordinal]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.III Def.2.16(2); print158; PDF170","verification_status":"source-definition-checked","source_statement_status":"checked-against-book","proof_status":"definition-well-defined","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-hardy-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-hardy-hierarchy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-hardy-hierarchy — Hardy 层次"},{"key":"chapter","html":"III"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2e4aa3df9477aa6f\" href=\"?note=2e4aa3df9477aa6f\" title=\"72-df-tree-ordinal\">72-df-tree-ordinal</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.III Def.2.16(2); print158; PDF170"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-against-book"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"definition-well-defined"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega,\\mathbf0,\\mathsf S,\\mathsf L\">\\(\\Omega,\\mathbf0,\\mathsf S,\\mathsf L\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2e4aa3df9477aa6f\" href=\"?note=2e4aa3df9477aa6f\" title=\"72-df-tree-ordinal\">72-df-tree-ordinal</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\Omega\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\Omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H:\\Omega\\times\\omega\\to\\omega\">\\(H:\\Omega\\times\\omega\\to\\omega\\)</span> 由以下良基递归定义，写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_\\alpha(n)=H(\\alpha,n)\">\\(H_\\alpha(n)=H(\\alpha,n)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"H_{\\mathbf0}(n)\\coloneqq n,\\qquad H_{\\mathsf S\\alpha}(n)\\coloneqq H_\\alpha(n+1),\\qquad H_{\\mathsf L((\\alpha_i)_{i\\in\\omega})}(n)\\coloneqq H_{\\alpha_n}(n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[H_{\\mathbf0}(n)\\coloneqq n,\\qquad H_{\\mathsf S\\alpha}(n)\\coloneqq H_\\alpha(n+1),\\qquad H_{\\mathsf L((\\alpha_i)_{i\\in\\omega})}(n)\\coloneqq H_{\\alpha_n}(n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：第 III 章 Definition 2.16(2)，印刷 p.158 / PDF p.170；已目视核对原页。递归参数是整棵带基本序列的树；后继虽增加数值输入，却严格降低树参数，故不破坏良基性。这一定义与改写为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_\\alpha(n)+1\">\\(H_\\alpha(n)+1\\)</span> 不同。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-tree-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"2e4aa3df9477aa6f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-tree-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-tree-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"2e4aa3df9477aa6f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Omega,\\mathbf0,\\mathsf S,\\mathsf L$ 见 [[72-df-tree-ordinal]]；$\\alpha\\in\\Omega$，$n\\in\\omega$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Omega,\\mathbf0,\\mathsf S,\\mathsf L","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\in\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"H:\\Omega\\times\\omega\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"H_\\alpha(n)=H(\\alpha,n)","display":false},{"tex":"H_{\\mathbf0}(n)\\coloneqq n,\\qquad H_{\\mathsf S\\alpha}(n)\\coloneqq H_\\alpha(n+1),\\qquad H_{\\mathsf L((\\alpha_i)_{i\\in\\omega})}(n)\\coloneqq H_{\\alpha_n}(n).","display":true},{"tex":"H_\\alpha(n)+1","display":false}],"bytes":1276,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-123","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-hardy-hierarchy|df-hardy-hierarchy — Hardy 层次]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-123","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-hardy-hierarchy|df-hardy-hierarchy — Hardy 层次]]"},{"id":"246d4beb5dedc741","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$H$ 见 [[72-df-hardy-hierarchy]]；$\\oplus$ 见 [[72-df-tree-ordinal-arithmetic]]。$\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\Omega$，$n\\in\\omega$。函数复合按 $(f\\circ g)(n)=f(g(n))$ 解释。"},{"id":"f6e6568ea7b179d6","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G,H,B,F$ 分别见 [[72-df-slow-growing-hierarchy]]、[[72-df-hardy-hierarchy]]、[[72-df-fast-growing-hierarchy]]。"},{"id":"8d01f06a62827a91","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Omega_s,\\prec,\\alpha[n]$ 及递增穷尽见 [[72-thm-structured-predecessor-exhaustion]]；$G_\\alpha(n)=|\\alpha[n]|$ 与有限树序数 $\\overline k$ 见 [[72-thm-slow-growing-arithmetic-homomorphism]]；$H,B,F$ 及有限迭代见 [[72-df-hardy-hierarchy]]、[[72-df-fast-growing-hierarchy]]。"}],"outgoing":["2e4aa3df9477aa6f"]}